[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:115. Knock, Knock]
[00:00.460]Lesson 115. | 第115课。
[00:02.970]Isn't there anyone at home? | 家里没人吗？
[00:06.175]I'll knock again, Helen. | 我再敲一下，海伦。
[00:08.565]Everything's very quiet. | 一切都很安静。
[00:10.780]I'm sure there's no one at home. | 我确信家里没有人。
[00:13.635]But that's impossible. | 但那不可能。
[00:16.355]Pat and Tom invited us to lunch. | 帕特和汤姆邀请我们吃午饭了。
[00:19.590]Look through the window. | 看看窗户。
[00:22.490]Can you see anything? | 你看到什么了吗？
[00:25.410]Nothing at all. | 什么都没有。
[00:27.740]Let's try the back door. | 我们试试后门。
[00:30.940]Look, everyone's in the garden. | 看，大家都在花园里。
[00:34.910]Hello, Helen. | 你好，海伦。
[00:36.660]Hello, Jim. | 你好，吉姆。
[00:37.975]Everybody wants to have lunch in the garden. | 大家都想在花园里吃午饭。
[00:40.685]It's nice and warm out here. | 这里又好又暖和。
[00:43.260]Come and have something to drink. | 快来喝点什么。
[00:45.960]Thanks, Pat. | 谢谢，帕特。
[00:47.060]May I have a glass of beer, please? | 我可以喝一杯啤酒吗？
[00:49.620]Beer? | 啤酒？
[00:50.625]There's none left. | 没有了。
[00:52.405]You can have some lemonade. | 你可以喝些柠檬水。
[00:54.740]Lemonade? | 柠檬水？
[00:56.910]Don't believe her, Jim. | 别相信她，吉姆。
[00:59.210]She's only joking. | 她只是在开玩笑。
[01:01.000]Have some beer. | 喝点啤酒吧。